WEBVTT

00:09:29.773 --> 00:09:32.234
Family members have witnessed

00:09:32.234 --> 00:09:35.779
how these amazing children
use communication skills

00:09:35.821 --> 00:09:38.699
they learned in the metaverse
in the real world.

00:09:40.409 --> 00:09:44.204
And metaverses can help
charities reach new audiences

00:09:44.246 --> 00:09:48.751
and make it more fun and easy
to participate in charity events.

00:09:48.792 --> 00:09:50.919
The World of Warcraft
community, for example,

00:09:50.919 --> 00:09:54.048
raised more than one million dollars
[for] Doctors Without Borders

00:09:54.048 --> 00:09:57.635
to be able to make a difference
in the global response to COVID-19.

00:09:58.510 --> 00:09:59.762
In the metaverses,

00:09:59.762 --> 00:10:02.056
charities can meet people where they are.